     1835   :
     1836     if ub.rvs-doc.shift-date = x-date-Start and ub.rvs-doc.shift-num < x-Shift-Start then next .
     1837     if ub.rvs-doc.shift-date = x-date-End   and ub.rvs-doc.shift-num > x-Shift-End then next .
     1838     for each ub.rvs-line no-lock
